### Locator status
GET http://localhost:8000/locator/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Locator suggest – basic query
GET http://localhost:8000/locator/address/suggest?query=123%20Main%20St&country=US&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Locator metrics – Prometheus text
GET http://localhost:8000/locator/metrics
Accept: text/plain
